# STAGERZ — repository ignore rules
#
# Added in Phase 21.8A alongside the first capture of Supabase Edge
# Function source. The repository had no .gitignore before this point.
#
# The captured Edge Function sources under supabase/functions/ ARE
# tracked deliberately — they are the forensic record of what is
# deployed. What must never be tracked is anything carrying a secret
# value or anything the tooling generates.

# --- Secrets: never commit values ---------------------------------
# Environment-variable NAMES appear in the captured source and in the
# phase documentation, which is fine. Their VALUES must never be here.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Supabase CLI local state -------------------------------------
supabase/.temp/
supabase/.branches/

# --- Dependencies and build output --------------------------------
node_modules/

# --- OS / editor noise --------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
